ng operator] Only the PostgreSQL plan has Gather Merge over (orders, customer, nation, region, lineitem, supplier) (collects sorted rows from parallel workers, keeping the order).\n8. [Missing operator] Only the PostgreSQL plan has Aggregate (Sorted, Partial) over (orders, customer, nation, region, lineitem, supplier) (computes aggregates (GROUP BY, SUM, COUNT, ...)).\n9. [Missing operator] Only the PostgreSQL plan has Sort over (orders, customer, nation, region, lineitem, supplier) (sorts its input).\n10. [Extra operator] Only the AI plan has Hash over (orders, customer, nation, region) (builds the in-memory hash table for a Hash Join). The AI's reason: \"Hashing filtered orders.\"\n\nSIMILARITIES\n- Both plans join the tables in the same order (every intermediate join result is the same).\n- Both plans use Hash Join of (orders) with (customer, nation, region).\n- Both plans use Seq Scan on orders.\n- Both plans use Hash Join of (customer) with (nation, region).\n- Both plans use Seq Scan on customer.\n- Both plans use Hash Join of (nation) with (region).\n- Both plans use Seq Scan on nation.\n- Both plans use Seq Scan on region.\n- Both plans use Seq Scan on supplier.",
